COMMENT ON COLUMN maintenance_attempt.status IS '状态：SCHEDULED 已派 / IN_PROGRESS 作业中 / SUSPENDED 救援挂起 / COMPLETED 完成 / LATE_REPORTED 迟到回报 / CANCELLED 手工结清取消';
